+        // down'); window end without a hit = 'missed'"): a clear always prints "target
+        // down", however the session actually closed (the SQUADCLEARGRACE exit in
+        // squadupdate() below, or a natural window-end SQUADEND_TIMEOUT landing in the
+        // very same frame as the kill - `cleared` is the source of truth here, not
+        // `reason`). A miss only prints on a natural SQUADEND_TIMEOUT ("window end
+        // without a hit"); a deliberate SQUADEND_BAIL (jump) or an external SQUADEND_ABORT
+        // (map change/disconnect/etc.) stay silent - no result to report.
+        if(squadsess.cleared) conoutf(CON_GAMEINFO, "target down");
