+    // SwiftGibs Reverse Firing Squad (Task 3, ADR-0003): tunables for the virtual rifle's
+    // cosmetic feedback. SQUADGIBDAMAGE only feeds gibeffect() (dummies have no health) -
+    // chosen to match a real instagib kill (weapon.cpp's guns[] table: GUN_RIFLE damage
